            ai-text-plugin (generateText) — streaming (onChunk), stopSequences, startWith
            text-to-image-plugin (generateImage) — negativePrompt, resolutions (512x768 / 768x512 / 768x768), removeBackground
            kv-plugin — all persistence (saves, libraries, gallery), per-folder folders
            super-fetch-plugin — CORS-free page fetching (used by "scenario from URL")
        core-loop
          title = Core Game Loop
          bullets
            Visual-novel engine: scene viewport, character overlays, dialogue box, narration box, choices
            AI story generation streamed segment-by-segment, continue indicator, advance
            AI-generated choices + free-text custom action input
            First/third-person POV modes
            Two game modes: Regular (narrative) / Sandbox (RPG stats bar, day/time tracking, inventory, training tags)
            Scene background generation with per-scene cache; character overlay sprites with speaking/dimmed states
            Roster of introduced characters (clickable, opens character modal)
            Auto-save checkpoints + rewind scene; story history viewer
            Edit generated scene text / segment text in place; regenerate choices
