            Fur/anime/fantasy appearance options; distinctive features sanitization
            Race system: races → sub-race variants → cultures, per-race skin tones, race/variant/culture libraries
            Name generation across many cultural origins (tagged pools, culture-matched first+surname)
            Portrait + sprite generation with multiple outfit/stage variants (undress stages), sprite lock, pre-gen queue
